  "question": {
    "text": "Given below are two statements. One is labelled as Assertion (A) and the other is labelled as Reason (R).\nAssertion (A) : The binding energy per nucleon is found to be practically independent of the atomic number A, for nuclei with mass numbers between 30 and 170.\nReason (R): Nuclear force is long range.\nIn the light of the above statements, choose the correct answer from the options given below :",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "XSb0p",
      "text": "$(A)$ is true but (R) is false",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
