      "text": "(A) is false but (R) is true",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "MU9kJ",
      "text": "Both $(\\mathbf{A})$ and $(\\mathbf{R})$ are true and $(\\mathbf{R})$ is the correct explanation of $(\\mathbf{A})$",
      "image": null,
